  "prompt": "How many days did each promotion run? A promotion runs on every day from its start_date to its end_date, and both of those days count, so a promotion that starts and ends on the same day ran for 1 day. Return two columns, in this order: promo_code, and days_running, the number of days it ran. Return one row for each promotion. Any row order is fine.",
